  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89d7972a26b27e65",
      "translationZh": "在 Foundation Models framework 中借助 Claude 为 Apple 平台构建智能应用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5772b2809f137b4",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们通过一个新的 Swift 软件包推出了 Foundation Models framework 对 Claude 的支持，让 Apple 开发者能够使用 Apple 的 Foundation Models framework 调用 Claude，处理更复杂的工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa516a672942ce3e",
      "translationZh": "Apple 的 Foundation Models framework 让开发者能够直接从 Swift 原生调用模型。它非常易于使用，只需短短三行代码，就能通过引导式生成返回带类型的 Swift 值。开发者可以借此调用 Apple 的端侧模型，快速完成摘要或信息提取等本地任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c71a06981611aaa7",
      "translationZh": "现在，当请求需要多步推理、代码生成等能力时，开发者可以使用 Apple 的 Foundation Models framework 将任务交给 Claude。Claude 还可以搜索网络以获取最新信息，并执行代码进行数据分析。将 Claude 的响应以流式方式传回同一个视图。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75f01b39f7ce4f2b",
      "translationZh": "由于 Apple 的框架会根据 @Generable 注解返回带类型的 Swift 值，开发者在调用 Claude API 时，使用的是经过整理的输入，而不是原始用户文本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76763c37b436ae29",
      "translationZh": "Foundation Models framework 已经为一系列智能端侧功能提供支持——日记应用呈现个性化提示，文档应用总结合同，学习应用根据学生的水平解释概念。加入 Claude 后，每一种模式都能得到拓展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09dc169eb9b58bf8",
      "translationZh": "日记应用可以在设备上生成每日提示，然后请 Claude 找出数月日记内容中贯穿的线索。学习应用可以在设备上解释一个术语，然后在学生追问“为什么这对我们学过的其他所有内容都很重要？”时，将任务交给 Claude。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b54f1fca840a149",
      "translationZh": "对用户而言，这是一段统一的体验，背后则由适合的模型为每个步骤提供支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86ca514453af6811",
      "translationZh": "探索更多产品资讯，以及面向使用 Claude 进行构建的团队的最佳实践。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "eca88f263f68bd33",
      "translationZh": "使用模组定制 Claude Code",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9ad98287a73ec34e",
      "translationZh": "Claude for Government 现已正式开放使用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e5bd39b5e66aae0d",
      "translationZh": "为 Claude 构建插件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "60f5aa70d16613dc",
      "translationZh": "Claude Marketplace：一站式发现来自我们合作伙伴的插件、智能体和服务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b8efdb74cc67b418",
      "translationZh": "借助 Claude 变革您组织的运作方式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "804ae5cd41268915",
      "translationZh": "订阅开发者通讯",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1392200d117522a4",
      "translationZh": "产品更新、操作指南、社区亮点等内容，每月发送至您的收件箱。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1fc098e3bbb49641",
      "translationZh": "谢谢！您已成功订阅。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "611a3627b4ce510d",
      "translationZh": "抱歉，您提交时出现了问题，请稍后重试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
